</div><div><section class="u-section u-background-orange u-hide-tablet"><div class="sticky_section_component"><div class="sticky_section_column"><div data-wf--spacer--section-space="main" class="u-section-spacer w-variant-60a7ad7d-02b0-6682-95a5-2218e6fd1490 u-ignore-trim"></div><div class="section_orange_content"><div data-wf--typography-heading--font-style="h2" class="c-heading w-variant-433d40c6-c261-f13f-c899-61d2cadf150f w-richtext u-text-transform-uppercase u-text-style-h3 u-mb-6"><p><font dir="auto" style="vertical-align: inherit;"><font dir="auto" style="vertical-align: inherit;">Â¿Por quÃ© existe BIT?</font></font></p></div><div class="sticky_section_paragraph first"><div data-wf--typography-paragraph--font-style="inherit" class="c-paragraph w-richtext u-mb-6 u-rich-text u-max-width-50ch u-child-contain u-color-dark"><p>Bitcoin began as a single line of code â€“ an idea quietly shared on a mailing list that sparked revolutions in technology, finance and human thought. Beyond the headlines, price charts and market cycles, lies a profound cultural shift â€“ one that invites us to reconsider value, trust power, and the nature of money itself.</p></div></div><div class="sticky_section_paragraph second"><div data-wf--typography-paragraph--font-style="inherit" class="c-paragraph w-richtext u-rich-text u-max-width-50ch u-child-contain u-color-dark u-mb-6"><p>BIT exists to explore that shift, not through technical whitepapers or financial analysis, but through art, expression and imagination.</p></div></div><div class="sticky_section_paragraph third"><div data-wf--typography-paragraph--font-style="inherit" class="c-paragraph w-richtext u-rich-text u-max-width-50ch u-child-contain u-color-dark u-mb-6"><p>Just as Bitcoin itself is the product of collaboration, built openly by contributors around the world, this book mirrors that spirit of collective creativity and shared vision.</p></div></div><div class="sticky_section_paragraph fourth"><div data-wf--typography-para