ation_slider_bullet_item swiper-slide swiper-slide-visible" role="group" aria-label="5/5"><div class="revelation_slider_bullet_image"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/688ab5ee36412534cd1202ec/68df27c5eb2eab708006d995_9a7788e195a3af1d98d33204e6d63bf6_Revelation%20Thumb%205.webp" alt="Libro complementario de BIT History of Bitcoin Revelations" class="revelation_slider_bullet_visual" style="transform: translate3d(0px, 0px, 0px) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0deg) rotateY(0deg) rotateZ(0deg) skew(0deg, 0deg); transform-style: preserve-3d;"></div></div></div><span class="swiper-notification" aria-live="assertive" aria-atomic="true"></span></div></div><div id="w-node-e8bc5b12-8b34-60e0-d6f1-1cebdcb04328-dcb04306" class="u-flex-vertical-nowrap u-gap-6"><div data-wf--typography-heading--font-style="h2" class="c-heading w-variant-433d40c6-c261-f13f-c899-61d2cadf150f w-richtext u-color-gradient u-text-transform-uppercase u-text-style-h3"><p>RevElations</p></div><div data-wf--typography-paragraph--font-style="inherit" class="c-paragraph w-richtext u-rich-text u-max-width-60ch u-child-contain fade-up" style="transform: translate3d(0px, 50px, 0px) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0deg) rotateY(0deg) rotateZ(0deg) skew(0deg, 0deg); transform-style: preserve-3d; opacity: 0;"><p>Revelations is the pocket-sized companion to BIT. It connects each artwork to the history it represents. Where the art captures Bitcoinâ€™s defining moments, Revelations anchors them in fact and memory.</p></div><div><div data-wf--typography-paragraph--font-style="inherit" class="c-paragraph w-richtext u-rich-text u-max-width-60ch u-child-contain fade-up" style="transform: translate3d(0px, 50px, 0px) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0deg) rotateY(0deg) rotateZ(0deg) skew(0deg, 0deg); transform-style: preserve-3d; opacity: 0;"><p><strong>Stories from behind the work<br></strong>The research draws on first-hand accounts from more than 100 early Bitcoiners, including Martti Malmi, Theymos, Trace Mayer, Samson Mow, Tim Draper, and Jameson Lopp. Their voices ensure accuracy while adding the personal perspective of those who helped shape events.</p></div></div><div><div data-wf--typography-paragraph--font-style="inherit" class="c-paragraph w-richtext u-rich-text u-max-width-60ch u-child-contain fade-up" style="transform: translate3d(0px, 50px, 0px) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0deg) rotateY(0deg) rotateZ(0deg) skew(0deg, 0deg); transform-style: preserve-3d; opacity: 0;"><p><strong>Designed as a companion</strong><br>Created to be read alongside the artbook, Revelations offers the feel of a gallery visit: seeing the work and learning the story behind it. Produced in a handheld bible format, printed on bible paper, leather bound, and finished with gold foiling, it is a book to be opened, studied, and returned to often.</p></div></div></div></div><div data-wf--spacer--section-space="small" class="u-section-spacer w-variant-d422cbd0-f212-c815-68df-63414354c21d u-ignore-trim"></div><div class="specs-grid u-grid-autofit"><div data-wf--feature-card--variant="base" class="features_card u-flex-vertical-nowrap u-gap-2"><div class="icon_2x2"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/688ab5ee36412534cd1202ec/689921047a57ad607e0f38ec_Pages.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="u-image"></div><div class="features_card_title u-text-style-large">Pages</div><div class="features_detail u-color-faded">350 pages</div></div><div data-wf--feature-card--variant="base" class="features_card u-flex-vertical-nowrap u-gap-2"><div class="icon_2x2"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/688ab5ee36412534cd1202ec/68992104e013de391d0a3823_Dimensions.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="u-image"></div><div class="features_card_title u-text-style-large">Dimensions</div><div class="features_detail u-color-faded">15cm x 11.1cm x 1.7cm</div></div><div data-wf--feature-card--variant="base" class="features_card u-flex-vertical-nowrap u-gap-2"><div class="icon_2x2"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/